The Harrowgate Herald

KUDOS
Shout-out to Marisol Vance for staying late to get the Ashgrove Pumps rush or=
der out the door. That's the Harrowgate way.

TECH TIP
You can now reset your own password from the login screen. Ted would like to =
never hear the words 'I'm locked out' again.

SAFETY CORNER
393 days without a lost-time injury in the warehouse. Reminder: the rolling l=
adders in aisle 9 are tagged out until the new casters arrive.

WELCOME ABOARD
Please welcome Jun Park, who joins Accounting this month. Stop by and say hel=
lo, and go easy on the acronyms.

FROM THE PRESIDENT'S DESK
Thank you all for a strong second quarter. Our fill rate stayed above 97% whi=
le we moved the bulk stainless line to the new racking.

